##### Otter: Keep /dist tracked; ignore build/vcpkg caches; Rust runner target ignored; optionally ignore /vcpkg vendor dir.
##### Schneefuchs: Specific rules after general ones; Windows-friendly; no surprises.
##### Maus: Minimal, readable; comments explain intent.
##### Datei: .gitignore

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build trees (local)
build/
build-*/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# vcpkg work dirs & caches (local only) — keep vcpkg.json tracked
vcpkg_installed/
vcpkg_downloads/
vcpkg_buildtrees/
vcpkg_packages/
vcpkg_cache/
!vcpkg.json
!vcpkg-configuration.json

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendor repo directories kept out of Git by default
# NOTE: If /vcpkg is a submodule, .gitmodules/.git will track it explicitly;
#       this ignore entry does not break an existing submodule.
vcpkg/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# VS / IDE metadata
*.suo
*.user
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
ipch/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
.vs/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# CMake generator files
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeUserPresets.json
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
compile_commands.json

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Common temporaries
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled artifacts (we stage selected ones into /dist)
*.obj
*.o
*.lib
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.dmp
*.ilk

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep /dist in the repo (staged outputs live here)
!dist/
!dist/**

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust: ignore target trees (keep sources)
target/
rust/otter_proc/target/
# If you ever want to pin the runner binary (not recommended), unignore it explicitly:
# !rust/otter_proc/target/release/otter_proc.exe

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific
imgui.ini
wupp.txt

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Archives
*.zip
*.7z
OtterDream_Project.zip
# …but keep any archives produced under /dist (pack step, release bundles):
!dist/*.zip
!dist/**/*.zip
!dist/*.7z
!dist/**/*.7z
